DESCRIPTION:Halloween is coming\, and so is the HALLOWEEN HUNT Adventure Ra
 ce! Get your costumes ready and meet us at Bryson Gym at 10:00 AM on Satur
 day\, October 31st for some Crazy\, Spooky Fun.\n\nGather your team of thr
 ee adventurers and dare to challenge the hunt! 👻\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\n
 The Hunt: A thrilling campus-wide scavenger hunt spanning the campus\, far
 m\, forest\, and river.The Trials: Challenge stations that will test your 
 wits\, bravery\, and teamwork against the clock.The Glory: Compete for ult
 imate bragging rights and awesome prizes!Prizes Categories:\n\n🏆 Best D
 ressed Team🎉 Most FUN Team🔥 High Spirited Team⚡ Fastest Team (most
  challenges completed within the time limit)Grab some like-minded folks fr
 om your crew\, classes\, affinity groups\, athletics teams\, FYS\, or just
  a group of friends\, and come out to play!\n\nWant to learn more - Stop b
 y the Adventure Programs lunch table\, or email Bruce Hills at bhills@warr
 en-wilson.edu.\n\nSee you this Halloween!  \nYour Friends at Adventure Pro
 grams
LOCATION:Bryson Gym
SUMMARY:HALLOWEEN HUNT Adventure Race
