DESCRIPTION:The Town of Black Mountain is advancing the Portmanvilla Area F
 lood Mitigation Project to reduce flood risks affecting nearby homes\, roa
 ds\, and community infrastructure. The project will evaluate improvements 
 including culvert replacements\, streambank stabilization\, roadway restor
 ation\, and drainage system \nenhancements to help improve resilience duri
 ng future storm events. The project focuses on three priority areas near P
 ortmanvilla Road\, Davis Drive\, 6th Street\, and 7th Street. A public mee
 ting is scheduled for Thur.\, Nov. 12\, 2026 from 4-6pm at Town Hall\, 160
  Midland Ave.\, Black Mountain\, NC 28711 for citizen input and to ask  qu
 estions about the project. This meeting is a drop-in event.  https://www.t
 ownofblackmountain.org/calendar.aspx?EID=2378
