SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ DJ Yaku Beat (Josh Courtney)
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, November 13th\nEvening
  Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\n
 Guest DJ: DJ Yaku Beat (Josh Courtney)\, Support Facilitator TBA\n\nIntent
 ion: TBA\n\n## About DJ Yaku Beat (Josh Courtney)\n\nYaku Beat channels th
 e spirit of water - flowing\, cleansing and alive. From a life in modern m
 edicine and entrepreneurship to years on the sacred plant medicine path\, 
 Josh's evolution has spanned many worlds. Guided by an appetite for self-r
 evelation\, his beats and live instrumentation will invite you into the de
 pths of your most wild and luminous heart.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please n
 ote that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening 
 Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to en
 sure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name
  your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Re
 commended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for fr
 ee! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/vo
 lunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0
 bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMD
 A4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_n
 rjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at t
 he beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CI
 RCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcoll
 ective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?
 fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyM
 jAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDtt
 Uv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Coll
 ective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be th
 eir authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to
  inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hos
 ting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c
 )(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 2880
 5\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/317175316/
