SUMMARY:Buncombe County Parks Update - Open and Closed Parks
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261116
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
X-TRUMBA-CUSTOMFIELD;NAME="Event Type";ID=21;TYPE=number:Park &amp\; Rec
 reation
X-TRUMBA-CUSTOMFIELD;NAME="Email";ID=35519;TYPE=Email:<a href="mailto:pa
 rks@buncombecounty.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">parks@buncombecou
 nty.org</a>
X-TRUMBA-CUSTOMFIELD;NAME="Phone";ID=35516;TYPE=PhoneUS10NoExt:(828) 250
 -4260
X-TRUMBA-CUSTOMFIELD;NAME="Notice - Description";ID=51963;TYPE=SingleLin
 e:Information about Open and Closed Parks
DTSTAMP:20250617T085331Z
DESCRIPTION:Email: parks@buncombecounty.org<br>Phone: (828) 250-4260<br>
 Notice - Description: Information about Open and Closed Parks<br><br>Man
 y Buncombe County Parks were impacted by Hurricane Helene.&#160\; While 
 we are working diligently reopen parks as quickly as we can\, some parks
  continue to remain closed. Please see the list below for which parks ar
 e open and which parks continue to be closed for safety reasons.<br><br>
 OPEN Parks:&#160\; Lake Julian Park (please note\, some disc golf holes 
 remain closed)\, Hominy Valley Park\, Collier Cove Nature Preserve\, Nor
 th Buncombe Fields\, Cane Creek Playground\, Buncombe County Sports Park
 \, Corcoran Paige River Park\, Bent Creek River Park\, Ledges Whitewater
  Park\, and Hominy Creek River Park.&#160\; If people choose to recreate
  on the river\, we strongly encourage them to be aware of changes on str
 eambanks and in the riverbed and the potential for unknown debris from H
 elene.<br><br>CLOSED Parks:&#160\; Charles D. Owen Park\, Karpen Soccer 
 Field\, Alexander River Park\, Walnut Island River Park\, and Glen Bridg
 e River Park*. *Note\, if the gate is open at Glen Bridge River Park\, i
 t may be used.&#160\; For safety reasons\, we ask the public not to ente
 r closed parks.<br><br>Please email <a href="mailto:parks@buncombecounty
 .org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">parks@buncombecounty.org</a> or cal
 l (828) 250-4260 with any questions or for additional information.
CATEGORIES:Parks &amp; Recreation
UID:http://uid.trumba.com/event/179136548
X-TRUMBA-LINK:https://www.buncombecounty.org/countycenter/events-calenda
 r.aspx?trumbaEmbed=view%3Devent%26eventid%3D179136548
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Amcdance": "https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/317175492/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_amcdance
X-SOURCE:Asheville Movement Collective
UID:event_317175492@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T051908Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T123000
SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Rory Jagdeo
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, November 15th\n1st Dan
 ce Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance
  Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilita
 tor Rory Jagdeo\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Rory Jagdeo\n\nRory is a sin
 ger/songwriter and an AMC Facilitator. He stepped into Ecstatic Dance in H
 ouston\, TX for the first time in 2014 and believes in the power of dance 
 to transform and bring a healthier\, happier\, and connected lifestyle. It
  is that driving force and passion that pushes him to explore the role of 
 being an Ecstatic Dance Facilitator using world rhythms and different musi
 cal genres to weave mixes that incorporate many elements of 8Rhythms.\n\\~
 \\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors c
 lose promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away
 . Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket 
 Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of fu
 nds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. V
 olunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://asheville
 movementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org
 /volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGY
 XBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWE
 zr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS
 :\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: 
 NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[http
 s://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementc
 ollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10
 YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUc
 bNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:
 \nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony wh
 ere all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. O
 ur mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community throu
 gh free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community trans
 formation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell
  Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/317175492/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261028T143320Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261028T143320Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
