X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncarboretum": "https://ncarboretum.org/event/hh-card-printing/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncarboretum
X-SOURCE:NC Arboretum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261119T150000
DTSTAMP:20261002T214826Z
CREATED:20261002T214826Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261002T214826Z
UID:1778780020233-1795093200-1795100400@ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:Handmade Holiday: Card Printing
DESCRIPTION:Handmade Holiday: Card Printing\nwith Erika Busse \nThursday\, November 19  |  1 – 3pm \nRegister Here!\nIn this workshop local artist Erika Busse will teach you how to create your own original linocut block and how to stamp it. This is a fun and handmade way to make many things\, and during this holiday season\, we will be stamping our blocks onto cards. You will get to print 5 cards in class (envelopes included) as well as keep your block to print more for your loved ones at home. All materials are included with this class. \nErika Busse moved to Asheville in 2017 after graduating from the University of Alabama with degrees in art and business. She is a small business owner of her full time artist business\, sharing mountain inspired painting and printmaking with the world. She has been teaching plein air painting classes since 2021. \n●  Members: Remember to enter your promo code upon checkout to receive your 10% member discount! Email adulteducation@ncarboretum.org with questions. \n●  See a full listing of Adult Education Programs at the North Carolina Arboretum here! Questions? Check our FAQs. \n●  We are committed to fostering a diverse\, supportive learning community. If the cost of a class is a barrier for you\, please complete this scholarship form and we will see what kind of assistance we can provide. \n●  Follow us on Facebook & Instagram! \n●  Join our Adult Education Student Hub on Discord! \n●  Interested in supporting the NC Arboretum more directly? Donate to the ONE Fund here. \nSee all of our classes open for registration here!
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/hh-card-printing/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/SantaCard.jpg
END:VEVENT
