X-SOURCE:Warren Wilson College
DTSTAMP:20261031T051946Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54303159122795
DTSTART:20261120T230000Z
DTEND:20261121T010000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us November 20\, at 6pm in Kittredge Theater for a screeni
 ng of the film Without Shade\, Without Rest. There will be light refreshme
 nts provided and a discussion of farm and food worker rights following the
  film. \n\n \n\nWeCount! is a non-profit\, human rights organization that 
 represents immigrant workers and families in South Florida\, including pla
 nt nursery workers. WeCount!’s advocacy on extreme heat is the subject o
 f the new documentary\, Without Shade\, Without Rest by Six Eye Films and 
 Working Films. This documentary tells the story of two organizations\, WeC
 ount! and the Coalition of Immokalee Workers\, and our efforts to win heat
  protections for Florida’s outdoor workers. In the face of intense indus
 try lobbying and aggressive state preemption\, the fight in Florida contin
 ues. Their work has helped put extreme heat in the national conversation a
 nd inspired advocacy for workplace heat standards across the country. \n\n
  \n\nWhile “Without Shade\, Without Rest” is primarily focused on Flor
 ida\, we believe this film can be a helpful tool for workers\, advocates\,
  organizations\, and community members across the country and world\, who 
 are similarly grappling with the growing and existential threat of climate
  change and extreme heat. We hope the film helps shine a light on an urgen
 t labor and human rights issue and contributes to meaningful dialogue and 
 connections across our movements. In Asheville\, a new campaign Planting J
 ustice (Sembra Justicia) is being launched by WeCount! and local partners 
 in support of workers in the house plant industry who work locally with li
 ttle labor protections. The food we eat and the plants we enjoy are nothin
 g without the workers who plant and nurture them.
GEO:35.613818;-82.438862
LOCATION:Kittredge Arts Center\, Kittredge Theater
SUMMARY:Without Shade\, Without Rest Film Screening and Discussion 
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.warren-wilson.edu/event/without-shade-without-
 rest-film-screening-and-discussion
CATEGORIES:Lecture
CATEGORIES:Performance
CATEGORIES:Social
END:VEVENT
