DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261122T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261122T123000
SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Marta Martín
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, November 22nd\n1st Dan
 ce Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance
  Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilita
 tor Marta Martín\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Marta Martín\n\nMarta (sh
 e/her/ella) has been part of AMC since she moved to Asheville from Surfsid
 e\, FL in 2008. She has been teaching movement for over 30 years\, using m
 usic and movements from around the world.\n\nShe loves to motivate people 
 to find freedom in their bodies so they can dance to the spirit.\n\nListen
  to her mixes on Mixcloud ([https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/](https:
 //www.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/) ) and Soundcloud ([https://soundcloud.co
 m/dancingmarta](https://soundcloud.com/dancingmarta) )\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\
 * Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly a
 t Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on 
 time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $
 30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-regis
 tration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and da
 nce for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollect
 ive.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbc
 lid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAz
 OTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2
 i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will 
 close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER 
 OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemo
 vementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/o
 ur-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXB
 wX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr
 2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Mov
 ement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are fre
 e to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and 
 aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form da
 nce by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC 
 is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville
 \, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/317175527/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261028T143800Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261028T143800Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
