BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncarboretum": "https://ncarboretum.org/event/creative-alchemy-winter-solstice/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncarboretum
X-SOURCE:NC Arboretum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261210T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261210T130000
DTSTAMP:20261023T185103Z
CREATED:20261023T185103Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T185103Z
UID:1778780020250-1796896800-1796907600@ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:Creative Alchemy: Winter Solstice - Dreaming Into the Dark
DESCRIPTION:Creative Alchemy: Winter Solstice – Dreaming Into the Dark\nwith Catherine Willows \nThursday\, December 10  |  10 am – 1 pm \nRegister Here!\nAs we enter the cold and dark of winter\, the Solstice invites us to slow down\, turn inward\, and listen to the quiet wisdom of the season. Gathering in the Arboretum\, we’ll connect with the rhythms of Nature and the stillness\, beauty\, and mystery held within this time of year. \nThrough guided reflection\, intuitive painting\, and the art-making experience\, you’ll enter the portal of creativity—the realms of color\, images\, and inner wisdom beyond words. Resting into the stillness and magic of the season\, we’ll make space for dreaming in the dark: bringing closure to the year while opening to the inklings\, possibilities\, and quiet stirrings of what may be revealed in the year ahead. \nNo art experience is needed—only curiosity\, an open heart\, and a willingness to explore. All art supplies will be provided. \nCatherine Willows is a Registered Nurse\, Certified Functional Medicine Health Coach\, and Transformational Creativity Coach\, and founder of Willows Coaching and Consulting. While holding sacred space\, she guides adults in awakening their inner creativity — moving beyond the demands of daily life into greater flow\, self-discovery\, and joy through intuitive art-making processes. Catherine believes creativity and our connection to the natural world are deeply interwoven — both vital pillars of wellbeing\, supporting nervous system regulation and inner equanimity\, and together essential for living a meaningful\, embodied life aligned with purpose and authentic expression. \n●  Pre-registration is required for all classes unless otherwise detailed above. \n●  Members: Remember to enter your promo code upon checkout to receive your 10% member discount! Email adulteducation@ncarboretum.org with questions. \n●  See a full listing of Adult Education Programs at the North Carolina Arboretum here! Questions? Check our FAQs. \n●  We are committed to fostering a diverse\, supportive learning community. If the cost of a class is a barrier for you\, please complete this scholarship form and we will see what kind of assistance we can provide. \n●  Follow us on Facebook & Instagram! Or join our Adult Education Student Hub on Discord! \n●  Interested in supporting the NC Arboretum more directly? Donate to the ONE Fund here. \nSee all of our classes open for registration here!
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/creative-alchemy-winter-solstice/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/20220112_cantrell_wintergarden_162-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
