SUMMARY:Again + Again: Work in Repetition
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261212
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261213
UID:65c0aa20f664e7bbe2d23f04e4a05168@asheville.com
DESCRIPTION:Cost: FREE | Recurring daily until Wednesday\, December 23\, 2
 026. Again + Again: Work in Repetition brings together artists whose pract
 ices center repetition as both process and possibility. Across media\, the
  exhibition features work shaped by recurring gestures\, techniques\, and 
 patterns\, where making again and again becomes a means of exploration and
  refinement…
LOCATION:Blue Spiral 1\, 38 Biltmore Ave. Asheville\, NC 28801
URL:https://www.asheville.com/event/again-again-work-in-repetition/2026-12
 -12/
X-SOURCE:Asheville.com, Hendersonville.com
END:VEVENT
