 pted at these meetings. To view draft agenda for an upcoming regular meeti
 ng\, once made available\, visit https://blackmountainnc.portal.civicclerk
 .com and go to the second Monday of each month's event posting.  https://w
 ww.townofblackmountain.org/calendar.aspx?EID=2183
